Revision history of WwW-GenGenLib-Template-Provider


0.00_00
    + RdKw::WwW::GenGenLib::Template::Provider: a Template
      Toolkit provider that names files as the locale does
      (to_fs of GenGenLib 0.0100), and loads only what the
      source declares in its header, or what those declare
      in theirs (walk_deps).  CHECK_DEPS => 0 stays shallow:
      anything may be loaded, and no header is read.
    + CHECK_HAVE => 1: the source must HAVE itself (siteconf
      checks that already, so it is off by default).
